    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n97266" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στρόμβ-ος</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>a body rounded</i> or <i>spun
				round</i>: hence, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			<i>top</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				14.413
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὥσπερ ς. στρέφεσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Asin.</u>
					42
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στροφάλιγξ</span>
			, <i>whirlwind</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				1084
			</span></i> (anap.), prob. in <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				195.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>trumpet-shell</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				492a17
			</span></i>, al.; <i>sea-snail</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Artem.
				2.14
			</span></i>; of a <i>shell used as a trumpet, conch</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lyc.
				250
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				9.25
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.713b
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>snail</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				548a18
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				530a6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PA</u>
				661a23
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στρόβιλος</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Th.</u>
				884
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>6.</b>
			<i>spindle</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lyc.
				585
			</span></i>.</div>
